# Build context for dashboard/Dockerfile, which builds from the repository root: only the dashboard, the app UI, and
# the JavaScript SDK (the app UI's gateway client) are sent, without local installs, build output, or test results.
# BuildKit reads this file in place of the root .dockerignore when the Dockerfile is dashboard/Dockerfile.
*
!dashboard
!app-ui
!sdk
sdk/*
!sdk/js
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.vite
**/*.local
